{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1309965-c20-and-the-hsien","id":1309965,"title":"c20 and the hsien","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-05-04T18:31:17-07:00","id":1309965,"title":"c20 and the hsien","content":"Hey i have a few problems with the hsien...mostly mechanically regarding one aspect that i have not found adequate mechanics for in the corebook or in the land of eight million dreams((which has a lot of focus on organized crime for some reason)). How do the hsien gather Yugen? Like outside of getting it from dragons nests,i have not really seen any proper mechanics for this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8100-caedus","name":"Caedus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"300"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-05T03:01:46-07:00","id":1310008,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caedus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1309965-c20-and-the-hsien#post1309965\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey i have a few problems with the hsien...mostly mechanically regarding one aspect that i have not found adequate mechanics for in the corebook or in the land of eight million dreams((which has a lot of focus on organized crime for some reason)). How do the hsien gather Yugen? Like outside of getting it from dragons nests,i have not really seen any proper mechanics for this.</div> </div> </div> </div>Basically, they collect it from the prayers of mortals at festivals, or from Dragon Nests.<br /> <br /> The errata also says: 'It is mentioned that hsien can gain Yugen from festivals, but it is never explained how this works. Small celebrations yield one Yugen, and larger ones may yield two or three. The Yugen generated depends on the size of the festival and the earnestness of its participants.'<br /> <br /> See here: <a href=\"http://www.oocities.org/timessquare/portal/8632/errata.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.oocities.org/timessquare/...32/errata.html</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":5291,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","user":"adambeyoncelowe","date":". 05-05-2019, 06:19 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-12T02:11:33-07:00","id":1311529,"title":"","content":"They can also gather it in areas where the Gauntlet is weak.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-07T23:11:17-07:00","id":1317120,"title":"","content":"Clearly we need more Hsien Content.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-08T05:02:51-07:00","id":1317159,"title":"","content":"I wonder if there's enough interest to get them to do a pdf for China and Japan? Who would we contact or petition for such? Or even apply to for permission to come up with a homebrew version to offer to the fan community?<br /> <br /> Until we can do any of that. I'd suggest reading what you can about Chinese folk festivals until something interesting strikes you as a good way for thr Hsien to gather Yurgen. Maybe just participation in the festivals themselves is enough.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-08T11:31:16-07:00","id":1317214,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Astromancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1309965-c20-and-the-hsien?p=1317159#post1317159\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder if there's enough interest to get them to do a pdf for China and Japan? Who would we contact or petition for such? Or even apply to for permission to come up with a homebrew version to offer to the fan community?</div> </div> </div> </div>And in the worse case, there's always STVault...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-08T16:21:38-07:00","id":1317243,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Astromancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1309965-c20-and-the-hsien?p=1317159#post1317159\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder if there's enough interest to get them to do a pdf for China and Japan? Who would we contact or petition for such? Or even apply to for permission to come up with a homebrew version to offer to the fan community?<br /> <br /> Until we can do any of that. I'd suggest reading what you can about Chinese folk festivals until something interesting strikes you as a good way for thr Hsien to gather Yurgen. Maybe just participation in the festivals themselves is enough.</div> </div> </div> </div>I imagine &quot;Do god stuff&quot; is probably important(answering prayers, punishing/rewarding people) If I was running a Hsien game I'd probably add some revelry equiv for each one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-08T16:47:06-07:00","id":1317250,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>adambeyoncelowe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1309965-c20-and-the-hsien?p=1310008#post1310008\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Basically, they collect it from the prayers of mortals at festivals, or from Dragon Nests.<br /> <br /> The errata also says: 'It is mentioned that hsien can gain Yugen from festivals, but it is never explained how this works. Small celebrations yield one Yugen, and larger ones may yield two or three. The Yugen generated depends on the size of the festival and the earnestness of its participants.'<br /> <br /> See here: <a href=\"https://&amp;quot;http://www.oocities.org/timessquare/portal/8632/errata.html&amp;quot;\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.oocities.org/timessquare/...32/errata.html</a></div> </div> </div> </